  {
    "id": "1817d5173cdf3689",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.4.2",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.4.2",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "v0.4.2 [DBR 13.3 LTS]\n\n- Geopandas now set to \"<0.14.4,>=0.14\" due to conflict with minimum numpy version in geopandas 0.14.4.\n\n- H3 python changed from \"==3.7.0\" to \"<4.0,>=3.7\" to pick up patches.\n\n- Fixes an issue with fallback logic when deserializing subdatasets from a zip.\n\n- Adjusts data used to speed up a long-running test.\n\n- Streamlines setup_gdal and setup_fuse_install functions:\n\n- init script and resource copy logic fixed to repo \"main\" (.so) / \"latest\" (.jar).\n\n- added apt-get lock handling for native installs.\n\n- removed support for UbuntuGIS PPA as GDAL version no longer compatible with jammy default (3.4.x).",
    "category": "Platform Overview",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "13dd7d421145b991",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.4.1",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.4.1",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "v0.4.1 [DBR 13.3 LTS]\n\n- Fixed python bindings for MosaicAnalyzer functions.\n\n- Added tiller functions, ST_AsGeoJSONTile and ST_AsMVTTile, for creating GeoJSON and MVT tiles as aggregations of geometries.\n\n- Added filter and convolve functions for raster data.\n\n- Raster tile schema changed to be <tile:struct<index_id:bigint, tile:binary, metadata:map<string, string>>.\n\n- Raster tile metadata will contain driver, parentPath and path.\n\n- Raster tile metadata will contain warnings and errors in case of failures.\n\n- All raster functions ensure rasters are TILED and not STRIPED when appropriate.\n\n- GDAL cache memory has been decreased to 512MB to reduce memory usage and competition with Spark.\n\n- Add RST_MakeTiles that allows for different raster creations.\n\n- Rasters can now be passed as file pointers using checkpoint location.\n\n- Added logic to handle zarr format for raster data.\n\n- Added RST_SeparateBands to separate bands from a raster for NetCDF and Zarr formats.",
    "category": "Data Engineering",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "dd369de6150f6e78",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.4.0",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.4.0",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "- First release for DBR 13.3 LTS which is Ubuntu Jammy and Spark 3.4.1. Not backwards compatible, meaning it will not run on prior DBRs; requires either a Photon DBR or a ML Runtime (Standard, non-Photon DBR no longer allowed).\n\n- New setup_fuse_install function to meet various requirements arising with Unity Catalog + Shared Access clusters; removed the scala equivalent function, making artifact setup and install python-first for scala and Spark SQL.\n\n- Removed OSS ESRI Geometry API for 0.4 series, JTS now the only vector provider.\n\n- MosaicAnalyzer functions now accept Spark DataFrames instead of MosaicFrame, which has been removed.\n\n- Docs for 0.3.x have been archived and linked from current docs; notebooks for 0.3.x have been separated from current notebooks.\n\n- This release targets Assigned (vs Shared Access) clusters and offers python and scala language bindings; SQL expressions will not register in this release within Unity Catalog.",
    "category": "Governance",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "2ee9debef3202bb0",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.3.14",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.3.14",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "- Fixes for Warning and Error messages on mosaic_enable call.\n\n- Performance improvements for raster functions.\n\n- Fix support for GDAL configuration via spark config (use 'spark.databricks.labs.mosaic.gdal.' prefix).",
    "category": "Platform Overview",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ae9e535d1f2d9702",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.3.13",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.3.13.2",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "R bindings generation fixed and improved.\n\nRemove usage of /vsimem/ drivers for GDAL due to memory leaks.\n\nAdd support for MapAlgebra expressions via RST_MapAlgebra.\n\nAdd support for custom combine python functions via RST_DerivedBand.\n\nImprove test coverage.\n\nAllow for GDAL configuration via spark config (use 'spark.databricks.labs.mosaic.gdal.' prefix).",
    "category": "Platform Overview",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "8485988a88b058df",
    "source": "github_release",
    "source_label": "GitHub · databrickslabs/mosaic",
    "title": "databrickslabs/mosaic: v0.3.12",
    "url": "https://github.com/databrickslabs/mosaic/releases/tag/v_0.3.12",
    "published": "2024-07-18",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "- Make JTS default Geometry Provider\n\n- Updated R bindings for sparkr and sparklyr\n\n- Add raster tile functions.\n\n- Expand the support for raster manipulation.\n\n- Add abstractions for running distributed gdal_translate, gdalwarp, gdalcalc, etc.\n\n- Add RST_BoundingBox, RST_Clip, RST_CombineAvg, RST_CombineAvgAgg, RST_FromBands, RST_FromFile, RST_GetNoData,\n\nRST_InitNoData, RST_Merge, RST_MergeAgg, RST_NDVI, RST_ReTile, RST_SetNoData, RST_Subdivide\n\n- Add RST_Tessellate that generates H3 tiles from rasters.\n\n- Add RST_ToOverlappingTiles that generates tiles with overlapping areas from rasters.\n\n- Add GDAL generic format reader.\n\nThis release is for DBR < 13, mainly DBR 12.2 LTS. Stay tuned for a release very soon that targets DBR 13.3 LTS.",
    "category": "Platform Overview",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/mosaic"
    ]
  },
